A block at a container's content column ends the paragraph, whatever it renders

```
- a
  {.k}
tail
.
<ul>
  <li>a
{.k}
tail</li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
  %% c
tail
.
<ul>
  <li>a
%% c
tail</li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
  %%% c
  %%%
tail
.
<ul>
  <li>a
%%% c
%%%
tail</li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
  [^f]: t
    more
tail

x[^f]
.
<ul>
  <li>a
[^f]: t
more
tail</li>
</ul>
<p>x[^f]</p>
```

